                "title": "Portmore Lever, Deltana ZPLR",
                "description": "Deltana ZPLR Portmore Lever -- Easy to install, the Portmore Lever is made for doors 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches thick with and adjustable backset from 2-3/8 inches to 2-3/4 inches. It will fit most pre-drilled doors. The contemporary shape is comfortable to grip while retaining a sleek appearance perfect for modern homes. It is available in satin nickel, polished chrome, and oil rubbed bronze finishes.",
